C. internal/jobs/ (new package, Layer: platform):

  doc.go                     Package doc + Layer header. Documents
                             the "Run<X>(ctx, deps...)" function
                             contract.
  embeddings_ttl.go          RunEmbeddingsTTL(ctx, deps) — re-reads
                             AIMode per tick (§I12). If off, returns
                             early. Otherwise:
                               DELETE FROM embeddings_768  WHERE expires_at < now()
                               DELETE FROM embeddings_1536 WHERE expires_at < now()
