D. internal/app/new.go (modified):

  Added jobs import. Added a.initAIBackgroundJobs(ctx) between
  initUnitDriftValidator and initHealthWatchdog. The new method:
    1. Spawns a goroutine.
    2. Runs jobs.RunEmbeddingsTTL once at boot.
    3. Tickers hourly thereafter.
    4. Each tick re-reads AIMode (§I12 — accommodates runtime flips).
  Constructor wiring is UNCONDITIONAL (always scheduled). The §I12
  re-check inside the job is what actually enforces off-mode
  silence; this design intentionally accommodates an operator
  flipping AIMode at runtime without restarting the API server.

